If a patient has an opioid-use-disorder then every clinician should offer a naloxone-dose to the patient and should provide a naloxone-overdose-reversal-training to the patient.
If a patient has an opioid-use-disorder then every clinician should offer a naloxone-dose to a patient-household-member and should provide a naloxone-overdose-reversal-training to a patient-household-member.
If a patient has an opioid-use-disorder then every clinician should offer a naloxone-dose to a patient-significant-other and should provide a naloxone-overdose-reversal-training to a patient-significant-other.
